        "original_id": "0401eaf2-033a-5177-a9e2-c16496b3f779",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: 133d Air Refueling Squadron, New Hampshire Air National Guard, 157th Air Refueling Wing, 509th Bomb Wing, Strategic Air Command\n- Places: Pease Air National Guard Base, Portsmouth, New Hampshire, United States, Pease Air Force Base\n- Products: General Dynamics FB-111A\n\nFacts:\n- The 133d Air Refueling Squadron is a unit of the New Hampshire Air National Guard's 157th Air Refueling Wing.\n- The 133d Air Refueling Squadron is located at Pease Air National Guard Base in Portsmouth, New Hampshire, United States.\n- Pease Air National Guard Base occupies part of the former Pease Air Force Base.\n- Pease Air Force Base was a former Strategic Air Command facility with a base-related population of 10,000.\n- Pease Air Force Base was home to the 509th Bomb Wing, which flew the General Dynamics FB-111A.",
